      "marginBottom": 12,
      "text": "The goal was to create a trustworthy company that felt safe visually, but also strong, and inspired by military colors and imagery. With a little humor thrown in.\nAs this is their first year in the market, initial discussions were focused around establishing the company within the community. A mail drop campaign was an inexpensive idea that the guys were very much pushing for.\nAfter discussing how to utilize this letter drop campaign creatively and effectively,\nwe decided on the concept of business cards that can be written on, drawn on, estimated prices on, and to play a game of fences/paddocks with your partner while you decide on maximum security or ultra maximum deluxe.\n",
